Badge details

Description of this badge

This badge recognizes learners who understand the difference between interest and true commitment. Recipients demonstrate a strong growth mindset and personal accountability by actively managing their time, overcoming limiting beliefs, and pushing beyond their natural comfort zones. They demonstrate resilience and perseverance, viewing setbacks as learning opportunities, and consistently apply positive action and self-care to achieve excellence in their IT careers.
Earning Criteria
Recipients must complete the earning criteria to earn this badge

To earn this badge, learners must demonstrate consistent commitment to their training by:

• Completing all five discussion board posts
• Complying with MyComputerCareer’s professional communication standards to promote collaboration and mutual respect

This badge demonstrates practice in self-reflection, effective communication, collaboration, support, professionalism, and strong work ethic, key traits for success in both training and the workplace.


